WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.251
Demonstrate ways people send and receive information.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:08.828
Information can be shared through letters, posters, newspapers, phone calls or text

00:00:08.828 --> 00:00:13.843
messages (SMS). The message should suit the audience and be clear and respectful.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:19.424
People can ask questions to check meaning. Children should protect private details

00:00:19.424 --> 00:00:23.361
and seek adult help before communicating with unknown people online.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:28.488
Role-play a polite phone conversation and write a simple class notice.
